      "retrieval": {
        "content": "Jevgrep: 1 relevant files.\nSymbols use name@start-end. Roles are estimates; locations-only files remain reading leads.\nAGENTS.md lookup (root and returned-file ancestors): none found.\n- \"queue.py\" \u2014 implementation, fixture, helper; source below\nEnd file list. Declaration locations follow source.\n\nSource block \"queue.py\" lines 1-13:\n```\nclass EventQueue:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.pending = []\n\n    def record(self, event):\n        self.pending.append(event)\n\n    def flush(self, sink):\n        batch = tuple(self.pending)\n        sink.write_batch(batch)\n        self.pending.clear()\n        return len(batch)\n\n```\n\nDeclaration locations:\n- \"queue.py\"\n  EventQueue.__init__@2-3\n  EventQueue.record@5-6\n  EventQueue.flush@8-12\n\nEnd context.\n",
        "duration_ms": 1483.36,
